WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:07,650
This is so scary, Dar.

2
00:00:07,650 --> 00:00:09,740
I want to go back and find Zhao Tong desperately.

3
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:12,060
You have to ask me if I agree

4
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,510
Want to give someone a head

5
00:00:14,510 --> 00:00:20,990
Thank you for your hard work, Kerry.

6
00:00:20,990 --> 00:00:23,220
Let others take advantage

7
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:25,220
He was rushed back by the barbarians.

8
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:30,180
It's not like trying desperately

9
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:33,920
It's like I'm being chased by something more terrifying.

10
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:38,130
What else could be better than a place?

11
00:00:38,130 --> 00:00:39,130
Keep an eye on them all

12
00:00:39,130 --> 00:00:41,130
Even a barbarian can't let me pass.

13
00:00:41,130 --> 00:00:43,130
Whoever I let go will be put in solitary confinement

14
00:00:43,130 --> 00:00:44,130
Do you understand?

15
00:00:44,130 --> 00:00:45,130
Got it
